(Overview) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
14 TL
(Orion is an internal document search service. It ingests PDFs from the shared) Tj
T*
(drive, embeds them, and exposes a question-answering endpoint to staff.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Status: draft. Owner: Platform team. Target release: Q3.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 15 Tf
20 TL
(Functional Requirements) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
14 TL
(FR-1 The system shall ingest PDF, DOCX and CSV files up to 50 MB each.) Tj
T*
(FR-2 The system shall return an answer within 5 seconds at the 95th percentile.) Tj
T*
(FR-3 Every answer shall cite the source document and page number.) Tj
T*
(FR-4 The system shall refuse to answer when retrieval confidence is below 0.35.) Tj
T*
(FR-5 Administrators shall be able to delete a document and its vectors together.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 15 Tf
20 TL
(Non-Functional Requirements) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
14 TL
(NFR-1 Availability target is 99.5 percent during business hours.) Tj
T*
(NFR-2 All documents remain within the ap-south-1 region.) Tj
T*
(NFR-3 No document content may be sent to third-party model providers without an) Tj
T*
(executed data processing agreement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 15 Tf
20 TL
(Architecture Decisions) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
14 TL
(ADR-01 We use a flat FAISS index rather than an approximate index because the) Tj
T*
(corpus is under 100,000 chunks and exact search keeps recall predictable.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ADR-02 Chunk size is fixed at 1000 characters with 150 characters of overlap.) Tj
T*
(Semantic chunking was evaluated and rejected for v1 on latency grounds.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ADR-03 Embeddings are generated locally with a sentence-transformer model so no) Tj
T*
(document text leaves the network during indexing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 15 Tf
20 TL
(Out of Scope for v1) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
14 TL
(Optical character recognition for scanned documents. Multi-language support) Tj
T*
(beyond English. Per-user access control; v1 assumes all staff may read all) Tj
T*
(indexed documents.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 15 Tf
20 TL
(Open Questions) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
14 TL
(Q1 How should the system handle documents that are superseded but not deleted?) Tj
T*
(Q2 Do we need an audit log of every query, and for how long must it be kept?) Tj
T*
ET
